@startuml state-session
title Session state diagram
hide empty description

[*] --> SCHEDULED : BookingConfirmed\n/ private room created

SCHEDULED --> SCHEDULED : a participant joins\n[from 15 min before the start]\n/ arrival recorded
SCHEDULED --> IN_PROGRESS : the second participant joins\n[both before 10 min after the start]\n/ SessionStarted
SCHEDULED --> CANCELLED : BookingCancelled
SCHEDULED --> ABANDONED : 10 min after the start\n[a participant had not joined]\n/ SessionAbandoned

IN_PROGRESS --> IN_PROGRESS : 5 min after start\n/ PresenceCodeIssued to each participant
IN_PROGRESS --> COMPLETED : EndSession\n[every participant confirmed presence]\n/ SessionCompleted
IN_PROGRESS --> UNVERIFIED : EndSession or code expired\n[a participant did not confirm]\n/ SessionUnverified

COMPLETED --> [*]
UNVERIFIED --> [*]
ABANDONED --> [*]
CANCELLED --> [*]

note right of ABANDONED
  Somebody did not come. The booking is
  NO_SHOW and the session never started.
  Tutor missing, student there: the student
  is refunded and told, and the tutor is
  recorded. Student missing, tutor there,
  or nobody there: nothing is returned,
  nobody is told and the tutor is not
  blamed or paid.
end note

note right of UNVERIFIED
  The tutor earns no credits,
  the student is refunded
  and audit records the failure.
end note
@enduml
